-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Test capability output for keyring isolation](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14927#discussion_r4460645011) · New\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nThis final layer of the multi-account prototype stack adds guided setup and evaluation tools around the existing identity system. It remains a draft experiment, not a merge-ready design.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Adds approval-focused onboarding guidance and evaluation scenarios.\n- Introduces live walkthroughs, offline regression journeys, and reset/downgrade checks.\n- Adds debug-only keyring isolation and a protected acceptance lifecycle.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `script/​multiaccount-review/​08-reset.sh` | Replays reset and stable-binary recovery. |\r\n| `script/​identity-e2e/​runner_test.go` | Tests runner setup, interaction, isolation, and cleanup. |\r\n| `script/​identity-e2e/​runner_helper_test.go` | Supplies fake gh and SSH executables. |\r\n| `script/​identity-e2e/​run.sh` | Adds guided live identity journeys and resource cleanup. |\r\n| `script/​identity-e2e/​reset_downgrade_test.go` | Checks configuration preservation across reset and downgrade. |\r\n| `script/​identity-e2e/​README.md` | Documents setup, evaluation, limitations, and recovery. |\r\n| `script/​identity-e2e/​offline_test.go` | Adds offline identity and routing regression journeys. |\r\n| `script/​identity-e2e/​fixture_test.go` | Provides synthetic accounts and simulated Git transports. |\r\n| `script/​identity-e2e/​boot